Package: rcxl
Type: Package
Title: Parse Excel Files
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Vincent", "Shields", email = "vince.shields913@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reads tabular data from 'xlsx' files with a specialized C parser.
    Worksheet XML is scanned in a single pass and decoded directly into R
    vectors, with no intermediate document model.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Suggests: readxl, cellranger
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
